  "reason": "Issue #3355 uses optional fail-closed controls for server-built Ari renditions and explicitly configured local or evaluation models; unset values keep those paths disabled; ARI_FLOW_ENGINE=on switches on the deterministic flow engine, and unset keeps it off. ARI_UNDERSTAND_FIRST=on|off overrides the staged \"Ari understands first\" rollout (ariRollout.ts) for a local stack or an eval run; unset, the rollout rows decide."
